Click here to go to the Metro Times Best of Detroit Survey: http://bit.ly/1nnUKED
If you love Western Market, we want you to tell the world! We're hoping to win Metro Time's Best of Detroit contest in the "Best Indie Grocer" and "Best Wine Selection" categories. There are hundreds of categories to vote in, but don't be overwhelmed: you only need to vote for 20 or so for your ballot to count. Be sure to put us down on the "Oakland County" line for questions number #42 and #46, and to join us for our free in-store wine tasting every Thursday night from 5 to 7.